    ["温和的神态中沉淀着岁月的痕迹。静静摆在案头，如同一位熟悉的老师在耐心听你讲述着近况。"] = "The gentle expression is settled with the traces of time. It sits quietly on the desk, like a familiar teacher patiently listening to you recount your recent life.",
